# UMC monorepo

Construction management application. npm workspaces monorepo, TypeScript everywhere, ESM only (`"type": "module"`).

## Layout

- `apps/web` – React + Vite SPA (`@umc/web`)
- `apps/api` – Express REST API with MongoDB/Mongoose (`@umc/api`)
- `packages/shared` – types and constants shared by both apps (`@umc/shared`)

## Commands (run from repo root)

- `npm run dev` – shared (watch) + api + web together
- `npm run dev:api` / `npm run dev:web` – run one app on its own
- `npm run build`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run test`, `npm run format`
- Add a dependency to a workspace: `npm i <pkg> -w @umc/api` (never `cd` into the app and install)

## Conventions

- Strict TypeScript; no `any` unless justified. Prefer `unknown` + narrowing.
- Use `import type` / inline `type` modifiers for type-only imports.
- Anything used by both the web and API (DTO types, enums, constants, route paths) belongs in `@umc/shared`. Never import from `apps/*` into another app.
- `@umc/shared` must stay runtime-agnostic: no Node, DOM, Express, Mongoose or React imports.
- Files and folders use kebab-case; React components use PascalCase exports.
- API responses use the `ApiResponse<T>` envelope from `@umc/shared`.
- Keep secrets in `.env` files (git-ignored); document every variable in the matching `.env.example`.
